{'symbol': 'SYF', 'date': '2021-11-04 08:03:00', 'title': 'SYNCHRONY LAUNCHES FIRST-OF-ITS-KIND PROGRAM IN STAMFORD TO PREPARE UNDERSERVED YOUTH FOR THE DIGITAL ECONOMY', 'text': "STAMFORD, CONN., NOV. 4, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0SYNCHRONY (NYSE: SYF), TOGETHER WITH CONNECTICUT NON-PROFITS DISTRICT ARTS & EDUCATION (DAE), THE UNIVERSITY OF CONNECTICUT'S ENGINEERING AMBASSADORS\xa0AND FUTURE5, TODAY ANNOUNCED A FIRST-OF-ITS KIND PROGRAM IN STAMFORD TO EQUIP HIGH SCHOOL STUDENTS FROM UNDERREPRESENTED BACKGROUNDS WITH DIGITAL AND SOFTWARE SKILLS."}